}

### Move a check item before itself. 400 notSibling on before, because the moving check item isn't its own sibling.
PUT {{prodigy_board_API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/check-items/{{checkItemNumbered}}/position
X-User-Id: {{actorId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "checklistId": "{{checkItemFollowUp}}",
  "before": "{{checkItemNumbered}}"
}

### Move a check item between anchors that aren't neighbours in that order. 400 notAdjacent on before, because Write notes sits between them.
